{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A01", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The minimum cooling‑off period an NBFC must give a borrower is one day.", "citations": ["D16_B_0019"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000164925, "gen_latency_s": 0.8831702999887057, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2219, "output_tokens": 91, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000164925, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0019", "D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0037", "D16_B_0073", "D16_B_0022"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04689379999763332, "total_latency_s": 0.9841389000066556, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A02", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "If a lender processes digital lending data outside India, the data must be deleted from servers located outside India and the data must be brought back to servers within India within 24 hours of processing. Additionally, any transfer of personal data outside India is only permitted if it complies with conditions set by the Central Government under the Digital Personal Data Protection Rules, 2025.", "citations": ["D16_B_0022", "D15_B_0018"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00017864999999999998, "gen_latency_s": 0.9353816999937408, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1970, "output_tokens": 199, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00017865, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0022", "D15_B_0018", "D16_B_0016", "D16_B_0024"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0400657999998657, "total_latency_s": 0.9755544000072405, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A03", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The cap on Default Loss Guarantee (DLG) cover is five percent (5%) of the total amount disbursed out of the loan portfolio at any given time.", "citations": ["D16_B_0033"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00020535, "gen_latency_s": 0.9322118000127375, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2690, "output_tokens": 108, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00020535, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0033", "D16_B_0005", "D16_B_0039", "D16_B_0034", "D16_B_0028"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.042189999992842786, "total_latency_s": 0.9745009999896865, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A04", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC must report all digital lending apps (DLAs) on the Centralised Information Management System (CIMS) portal of the Reserve Bank of India.", "citations": ["D16_B_0026"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000243225, "gen_latency_s": 0.9233563999878243, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2791, "output_tokens": 113, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000243225, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0026", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0027", "D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0013"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04174899999634363, "total_latency_s": 0.965222899991204, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A05", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "When a lending service provider (LSP) works with multiple lenders for digital lending, it must present the borrower with a digital view of all loan offers that match the borrower’s request. This view must display each lender’s name, the loan amount, tenor, APR, monthly repayment obligation, penal charges (if applicable), and a link to the lender’s KFS. It must also disclose the names of any lenders whose offers do not match the borrower’s request.", "citations": ["D16_B_0013"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00020722499999999998, "gen_latency_s": 0.8274302999925567, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2355, "output_tokens": 198, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000207225, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0013", "D12_B_0053", "D16_B_0016", "D12_B_0064", "D16_B_0021"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0412681000016164, "total_latency_s": 0.8688041000132216, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A06", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Yes. An NBFC may charge a reasonable one‑time processing fee if a borrower exits a digital loan during the cooling‑off period, provided that the fee is disclosed to the borrower upfront in the KFS.", "citations": ["D16_B_0019"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000247875, "gen_latency_s": 0.9553469000093173, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2697, "output_tokens": 152, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000247875, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0019", "D16_B_0018", "D16_B_0034", "D16_B_0005", "D16_B_0022"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.041739699998288415, "total_latency_s": 0.9971883999969577, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A07", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No. An NBFC‑run digital lending app must not access a borrower’s contact list or photos. The RBI direction explicitly states that the app should not access mobile phone resources such as file and media, contact list, call logs, telephony functions, etc.; only a one‑time access for camera, microphone, location, or other necessary facilities during onboarding/KYC is allowed with explicit consent.", "citations": ["D16_B_0021"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00021435, "gen_latency_s": 1.0197552000026917, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2106, "output_tokens": 188, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00021435, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0016", "D16_B_0013", "D16_B_0023", "D16_B_0014"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03949179999472108, "total_latency_s": 1.0593576999963261, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A08", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "If the lender does not reply within 30 days of receipt of the complaint, the borrower may lodge a complaint through the Reserve Bank‑Integrated Ombudsman Scheme’s Complaint Management System (CMS) portal or send a physical complaint to the Centralised Receipt and Processing Centre, 4th Floor, Reserve Bank of India, Sector –17, Central Vista, Chandigarh – 160017.", "citations": ["D16_B_0020"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000233775, "gen_latency_s": 1.0450203000073088, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2445, "output_tokens": 168, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000233775, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0016", "D16_B_0020", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0013", "D16_B_0014"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0406644999893615, "total_latency_s": 1.085791399993468, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A09", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A new payment aggregator seeking RBI authorisation must have a minimum net‑worth of ₹15 crore at the time of submitting its application, and must achieve a minimum net‑worth of ₹25 crore by the end of the third financial year after the grant of authorisation.", "citations": ["D06_B_0008"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00021525, "gen_latency_s": 1.4441643000027398, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2670, "output_tokens": 146, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00021525, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_B_0008", "D13_B_0009", "D06_B_0031", "D06_B_0007", "D11_B_0009"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0363426999974763, "total_latency_s": 1.4806136999977753, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A10", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An entity that is doing only PA‑P business must obtain authorisation by 31 December 2025. If it fails to apply by that date, it must inform its banker(s) immediately and wind up its business by 28 February 2026.", "citations": ["D06_B_0007"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002115, "gen_latency_s": 1.104718899994623, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2416, "output_tokens": 197, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002115, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_B_0007", "D06_B_0004", "D06_B_0017", "D06_B_0012", "D06_B_0006"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04992829999537207, "total_latency_s": 1.1547564000065904, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
