{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A12", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "Existing payment aggregators had to attain a net‑worth of ₹15 crore by 31 March 2021 and a net‑worth of ₹25 crore by 31 March 2023.", "citations": ["D05_B_0006"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000228525, "gen_latency_s": 1.2792637000093237, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2639, "output_tokens": 198, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000228525, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D05_B_0006", "D05_B_0007", "D06_B_0008", "D05_B_0008", "D05_B_0002"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04539889999432489, "total_latency_s": 1.3247706000111066, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A13", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "For digital payment transactions that are not card‑present, the directions require that at least one authentication factor be dynamically created or proven (i.e., proof of possession unique to the transaction) and that the transaction be authenticated by at least two distinct factors of authentication.\n", "citations": ["D10_B_0006", "D10_B_0005"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000182475, "gen_latency_s": 0.902177899988601, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1841, "output_tokens": 148, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000182475, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_B_0006", "D10_B_0005", "D10_B_0004", "D10_B_0013", "D14_B_0012"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0412038000067696, "total_latency_s": 0.9434826000069734, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A14", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Payment system providers must comply with RBI's Authentication Mechanisms Directions, 2025 by April 01, 2026.", "citations": ["D10_B_0002"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00015225, "gen_latency_s": 0.8526716999913333, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1642, "output_tokens": 97, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00015225, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_B_0002", "D10_B_0001", "D10_B_0000", "D10_B_0003", "D06_B_0000"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.041515099990647286, "total_latency_s": 0.8942799000069499, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A15", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "RBI requires that in a digital payment transaction, at least two distinct factors of authentication be used, and that the factors be independent – compromise of one factor must not affect the reliability of the other. In addition, at least one of the factors must be dynamic (unique to each transaction).", "citations": ["D10_B_0005", "D10_B_0007", "D10_B_0006"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000182775, "gen_latency_s": 0.9141562000004342, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1837, "output_tokens": 150, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000182775, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_B_0005", "D10_B_0006", "D10_B_0007", "D10_B_0001", "D13_B_0017"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03629289999662433, "total_latency_s": 0.9505459999927552, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.3333333333333333, "first_hit_rank": 3, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A16", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The maximum value of each prepaid gift instrument is Rs.10,000/-.", "citations": ["D11_B_0026"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000191325, "gen_latency_s": 0.7357460999919567, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2171, "output_tokens": 95, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000191325, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_B_0026", "D11_B_0006", "D11_B_0024", "D11_B_0043", "D11_B_0042"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.034942700003739446, "total_latency_s": 0.7707803999946918, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A17", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The minimum validity period of a prepaid payment instrument (PPI) is one year from the date of last loading or reloading.", "citations": ["D11_B_0041"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00020444999999999998, "gen_latency_s": 0.8865006999985781, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2334, "output_tokens": 98, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00020445, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_B_0041", "D11_B_0007", "D11_B_0009", "D11_B_0042", "D11_B_0013"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.033975300000747666, "total_latency_s": 0.9206042000005255, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A18", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The maximum amount outstanding allowed in a full‑KYC prepaid payment instrument (PPI) is Rs. 2,00,000/-.", "citations": ["D11_B_0024"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0001941, "gen_latency_s": 0.7076216999994358, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2476, "output_tokens": 124, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0001941, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_B_0024", "D11_B_0047", "D11_B_0025", "D11_B_0023", "D11_B_0042"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03628630000457633, "total_latency_s": 0.7440160999976797, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A19", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "For a small PPI (₹10,000 or less), cash withdrawal or any funds transfer is not permitted. The issuer may only allow closure of the PPI, and the closure proceeds can be transferred back to the source account or to a bank account after KYC. There is no provision for routine cash withdrawal or transfer from the balance of such a PPI.", "citations": ["D11_B_0021", "D11_B_0023"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023730000000000002, "gen_latency_s": 0.9178807999996934, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2696, "output_tokens": 213, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002373, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_B_0022", "D11_B_0025", "D11_B_0021", "D11_B_0023", "D11_B_0005"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.035661999994772486, "total_latency_s": 0.9536665000050562, "hit@5": 0, "rr@10": 0.0, "first_hit_rank": null, "gold_cited": false}
